        "text": "description: Redesign mobile app UI to feel unmistakably Apple-like, iOS-forward, and native. Use this skill when building iOS apps, applying Apple Human Interface Guidelines, or creating native-feeling mobile interfaces with SF Pro typography, translucency, and system-like components."
      },
