      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": "- Standard navigation bars"
      },
      {
        "line": 67,
        "text": "- Large titles when appropriate"
      },
      {
        "line": 68,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 69,
        "text": "### Modals & Sheets"
      },
      {
        "line": 70,
        "text": "- Bottom sheets preferred"
      },
      {
        "line": 71,
        "text": "- Respect drag-to-dismiss gestures"
      },
      {
        "line": 72,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 74,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 75,
        "text": "## Interaction & Motion"
      },
      {
        "line": 76,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 77,
        "text": "- Smooth, natural easing (no bounce unless system-like)"
      },
      {
        "line": 78,
        "text": "- Motion should explain hierarchy, not decorate"
      },
      {
        "line": 79,
        "text": "- Use fade, slide, and subtle scale"
      },
      {
        "line": 80,
        "text": "- All transitions should feel calm and intentional"
      },
      {
        "line": 81,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 83,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 84,
        "text": "## Platform Assumptions"
      },
      {
        "line": 85,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": "- Mobile-first"
      },
      {
        "line": 87,
        "text": "- iOS primary, Android secondary"
      },
      {
        "line": 88,
        "text": "- Gesture-driven interaction"
      },
      {
        "line": 89,
        "text": "- One-handed usability considered"
      },
      {
        "line": 90,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 91,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 92,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 93,
        "text": "## Output Requirements"
      },
      {
        "line": 94,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 95,
        "text": "For each redesigned screen:"
      },
      {
        "line": 96,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 97,
        "text": "1. Briefly explain the design intent"
      },
      {
        "line": 98,
        "text": "2. Describe layout structure clearly"
      },
      {
        "line": 99,
        "text": "3. Specify typography usage"
      },
      {
        "line": 100,
        "text": "4. Explain interaction & motion behavior"
      },
      {
        "line": 101,
        "text": "5. Justify decisions using iOS-native reasoning"
      },
      {
        "line": 102,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 103,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 104,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 105,
        "text": "## Absolute Avoid List"
      },
      {
        "line": 106,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 107,
        "text": "- Over-designed custom components"
      },
      {
        "line": 108,
        "text": "- Trendy UI gimmicks or effects"
      },
      {
        "line": 109,
        "text": "- Heavy gradients or neon colors"
      },
      {
        "line": 110,
        "text": "- Harsh borders or outlines"
      },
      {
        "line": 111,
        "text": "- Dense, cluttered information layouts"
      },
      {
        "line": 112,
        "text": "- Non-standard navigation patterns"
      },
      {
        "line": 113,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 114,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 115,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 116,
        "text": "## Decision-Making Rules"
      },
      {
        "line": 117,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 118,
        "text": "- Do NOT over-design"
      },
      {
        "line": 119,
        "text": "- If something feels unnecessary, remove it"
      },
      {
        "line": 120,
        "text": "- Clarity and familiarity are the highest priorities"
      },
      {
        "line": 121,
        "text": "- When in doubt, follow iOS system defaults"
      },
      {
        "line": 122,
        "text": "- Prefer removal over addition"
      },
      {
        "line": 123,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 124,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 125,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 126,
        "text": "## Summary Constraint"
      },
      {
        "line": 127,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 128,
        "text": "Every screen should feel like it belongs in a first-party Apple app \u2014"
      },
      {
        "line": 129,
        "text": "calm, confident, native, and inevitable."
      }
